"felt":{c:"Because it is made by pressing wool fibres together rather than weaving them, ---- keeps its shape even when it is cut without hemming.",b:"felt",f:"",tr:"Dokunarak degil, yun liflerinin birbirine bastirilmasiyla uretildigi icin kece, kenari bastirilmadan kesildiginde bile bicimini korur."},
"fiction":{c:"Librarians report that readers borrow ---- far more often during economic downturns, apparently seeking an escape from anxieties they cannot resolve in daily life.",b:"fiction",f:"",tr:"Kutuphaneciler, okurlarin ekonomik durgunluk donemlerinde kurgu turunu cok daha sik odunc aldigini, gorunuse gore gunluk hayatta cozemedikleri kaygilardan bir kacis aradigini bildiriyor."},
"fighting":{c:"Relief agencies could not reach the besieged city for weeks because ---- along the only access road made every convoy far too dangerous to attempt.",b:"fighting",f:"",tr:"Yardım kuruluşları kuşatma altındaki şehre haftalarca ulaşamadı, çünkü tek giriş yolu boyunca süren çatışmalar her konvoyu denenemeyecek kadar tehlikeli hâle getiriyordu."},
