"guy":{c:"In the interviews, survivors rarely called him a criminal; to most of them he was simply the ---- who had repaired their roofs after the flood.",b:"guy",f:"",tr:"Görüşmelerde hayatta kalanlar onu nadiren suçlu olarak niteledi; çoğu için o, selden sonra çatılarını onaran adamdı."},
"handed":{c:"Chemists explain that many molecules are ----, existing in two mirror-image forms whose biological effects can differ dramatically inside the human body.",b:"handed",f:"",tr:"Kimyacilar, bircok molekulun yonlu oldugunu, yani insan vucudunda biyolojik etkileri carpici bicimde farklilasabilen iki ayna goruntusu biciminde bulundugunu acikliyor."},
"headquarter":{c:"The bank was ---- in Geneva for over a century before regulatory pressure forced it to move its principal offices to Frankfurt.",b:"headquartered",f:"pp",tr:"Bankanin merkezi, duzenleyici baski ana ofislerini Frankfurt'a tasimaya zorlayana kadar bir asirdan fazla sure Cenevre'deydi."},
"healthier":{c:"Urban planners argue that residents of cities with extensive cycling networks are measurably ---- than those living in districts where every errand requires a car.",b:"healthier",f:"",tr:"Sehir plancilari, kapsamli bisiklet aglarina sahip kentlerin sakinlerinin, her isin araba gerektirdigi semtlerde yasayanlara kiyasla olculebilir bicimde daha saglikli oldugunu savunuyor."},
