"listening":{c:"Effective ---- is a skill that most managers never develop, since they interrupt colleagues long before the underlying complaint has been fully described.",b:"listening",f:"",tr:"Etkili dinleme, cogu yoneticinin asla gelistirmedigi bir beceridir, cunku onlar meslektaslarinin sozunu, asil sikayet tam olarak anlatilmadan cok once keserler."},
