"negotiate":{c:"Union representatives refused to ---- until the company withdrew its threat of redundancies, insisting that no agreement could be reached under such pressure.",b:"negotiate",f:"",tr:"Sendika temsilcileri, sirket isten cikarma tehdidini geri cekene kadar muzakere etmeyi reddetti ve boyle bir baski altinda hicbir anlasmaya varilamayacaginda israr etti."},
