"prepared":{c:"Villages along the fault line were simply not ---- for an earthquake of that magnitude, since no serious drill had been organised for more than twenty years.",b:"prepared",f:"",tr:"Fay hatti boyunca uzanan koyler bu buyuklukte bir depreme hazirlikli degildi, cunku yirmi yildan uzun suredir ciddi bir tatbikat duzenlenmemisti."},
